  "details": "There are some worlds that that crashes to \"desktop\" if I use Oculus VR to go to them.\nThere is no crash report generated the game simply closes.\nThis happened on Unity 2017 and is still happening on Unity 2018.\nThe worlds that I have identified so far that crashes like this are:\nAir Flow Cyclone by JackyGun\nGR's Score Attack［Beta］by GlassRaven\nThese worlds load fine if I run the desktop version of VRChat through Steam.\nBut if i run in VR either through Oculus native or SteamVR the game instantly crashes when loading the world.\nFor reference I'm using a Oculus Rift S on a computer with:\nCPU: Ryzen 7 3700X\nMB: ASUS ROG Strix X570-E\nGPU: Nvidia RTX 2070 Super\nOS: Windows 10 1909\nAll the latest drivers are installed",
